Package: readjsa
Title: Hardened Access to Jobs and Skills Australia Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Matt", "Cowgill", role = "aut",
           comment = "Original readjsa 0.0.1 implementation"),
    person("Chartwell", "Macro", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "chartwellmacro@gmail.com"))
Description: Discovers, downloads, verifies, caches, and parses official
    Internet Vacancy Index, Recruitment Experiences and Outlook Survey, and
    Small Area Labour Markets releases. Raw-file provenance, release vintage,
    classifications, revisions, and source terms remain attached to every
    observation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/chartwell-macro/readjsa
BugReports: https://github.com/chartwell-macro/readjsa/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    curl,
    digest,
    readr,
    readxl,
    xml2
Suggests:
    ps,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    writexl
Config/testthat/edition: 3
